1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,700
THE FORMER GROOM: I changed my mind.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,500
LADY JULIANA: You swore you loved me!

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,700
LADY IN GOLD GOWN: People change their minds, sister.

4
00:00:08,999 --> 00:00:10,300
LADY JULIANA: And you knew?

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,999
LADY IN GOLD GOWN: Of course I knew.

6
00:00:12,999 --> 00:00:14,200
LADY JULIANA: How long?

7
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:18,400
LADY IN GOLD GOWN: Long enough to know he was never going to marry you.

8
00:00:19,999 --> 00:00:21,100
LADY JULIANA: Father...

9
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,500
LADY JULIANA: Tell them this is a mistake.

10
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,800
LADY JULIANA: Father... please look at me.

11
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:31,800
MATRIARCH: Enough!

12
00:00:31,999 --> 00:00:35,400
MATRIARCH: You have embarrassed this family long enough.
